# 2D RBM in [0,10]x[0,10] with independent components.
# mu = (-1,-1), Sigma = I, R = I (normal reflection at all faces).
# Expected E[X_i] ~ 1/2 (truncated-exponential limit, b=10 large enough
# that truncation correction is < 1e-4).

dimension   2
grid_n      12
basis_m     6
grid_type   uniform
solver      highs

drift
  -1.0  -1.0

covariance
  1.0  0.0
  0.0  1.0

reflection_form  minus_only
reflection
  1.0  0.0
  0.0  1.0

upper_bounds
  10.0  10.0
